NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001120 "the same terms as the Perl 5 programming language system itself."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001121 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001122 "=head1 BUGS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001123 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001124 "Please report any bugs or feature requests on the bugtracker website L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=Color-RGB-Util>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001125 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001126 "When submitting a bug or request, please include a test-file or a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001127 "patch to an existing test-file that illustrates the bug or desired"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001128 "feature."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001129 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001130 "=cut"
BODY_END
